Hello everyone!

After a long development journey, I’m thrilled to share some big news: Harvest Hills will be released on January 15, 2025, on Steam for PC (Windows only).

Thanks to the feedback from two major demo updates, I’ve been able to fine-tune game mechanics and make the experience even better. The full game now features:

 An updated system for growing vegetables and fruits;
 An improved fertilizing system;
 A refined level system;
 A brand-new product-selling system;
 More crops, vegetables, fruit trees, livestock, and homemade product machines.

Make sure to wishlist the game if you haven’t already!😄

